msgid ""
"Some window decorations themes, e.g. Breeze or Plastik, could be installed in your system as binary libraries and thus be visible and usable in System settings, but they are not detectable and cannot be used by this widget. There are no plans to support such binary themes due to technical complications.\n"
"-\n"
"Regular Aurorae themes for window decorations are supported by this widget and you can install them in System settings through \"Window decorations\" page or use \"Breeze\" or \"Plasma\" options in \"Button icons source\" field above instead"
msgstr ""

